{"text": "From: Anneliese Friesen <afriesen@friesentkachuk.example>\nTo: \"Dhaliwal, Gurpreet\" <gurpreet.dhaliwal@prairiemail.example>\nCc: harjit.k.dhaliwal@prairiemail.example, closings@friesentkachuk.example\nDate: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 16:42:09 -0500\nSubject: RE: 418 Lanark Street - closing June 26 - funds and ID (our file 26-1187 RE)\n\nHi Gurpreet and Harjit,\n\nThanks for sending the IDs. A few things before closing on Friday, June 26, 2026.\n\n1. BALANCE TO CLOSE. Purchase price is $489,900.00. Your deposit of $20,000 is held\nby Red River Realty Group Inc. in trust. The mortgage advance from\nAssiniboine Prairie Credit Union is $391,920.00 (mortgage no. APCU-M-0077418). After Land Transfer\nTax of $7,726.00, our fees and disbursements of $1,684.35, and adjustments for\nproperty taxes, the amount we need from you is C$88,310.72.\n\n2. HOW TO SEND IT. Bank draft payable to \"Friesen Tkachuk Law Office, in trust\",\nor wire to our trust account:\n     Institution 879   Transit 00417   Account 1004-882-6\n     SWIFT (only if your bank asks): APCUCAW1\nPLEASE phone me at 204-555-0119 to confirm these numbers before you send anything.\nWe will never change wire instructions by email. Last month a client of another\nfirm received a fake \"updated instructions\" message that our IT person traced to\n203.0.113.57; if you get anything like that, call.\n\n3. ID / FINTRAC. I have your licences. Harjit, the passport scan you sent\n(Z4471902) is cut off at the bottom; can you resend? Also please confirm\ndates of birth as I have them: Gurpreet 1988-02-19, Harjit 1990-11-03, and\nyour SINs for the lender's forms. Gurpreet's I have as 548 275 650; I do not\nhave Harjit's. Do NOT email it; call Tyler at ext. 204.\n\n4. TITLE. Title no. 3304417/1, Winnipeg Land Titles District. There is a\ncaveat from 1962 for a utility easement along the lane, which is normal. Roll no.\n12-0-044718-0. The sellers' lawyer, Odette Lavallée at Lavallée & Partners LLP,\nconfirms vacant possession at 3:00 p.m.\n\n5. Since Harjit is here on a work permit and not yet a permanent resident, the lender\nwants a copy of the permit as part of Schedule A. That is their rule and has\nnothing to do with The Real Property Act.\n\nSigning appointment: Tuesday June 23 at 4:15, our office, 1210-363 Broadway,\nWinnipeg MB  R3C 3N9. Parking is off Carlton Street.\n\nAnneliese\n\nAnneliese Friesen | Partner\nFriesen Tkachuk Law Office\nT 204-555-0119  F 204-555-0120\nLaw Society of Manitoba no. 20071148\nAssistant: Tyler Kowalchuk, tkowalchuk@friesentkachuk.example\n\n> On Tue, Jun 16, 2026 at 9:03 PM Gurpreet Dhaliwal wrote:\n>\n> Hi Ms. Friesen,\n> Attached are both drivers licences. Mine is DH-AL-IW-G512KD. Harjit Kaur's is\n> under her maiden name still, hope thats ok. Our realtor Stefan said the\n> sellers want to move closing up a day?? We cant, the movers are booked and\n> my mother is flying in from Amritsar on the 25th. Also can you tell me the\n> exact amount, the bank says they need 2 days for a draft over 50k.\n> My cell is 204 555 0173 if easier. We are still at 55 Nassau St N apt 1407\n> until the 27th.\n> thx\n> Gurpreet\n>\n> Sent from my phone", "kind": "Email", "detail": "515 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Anneliese Friesen", "Gurpreet Dhaliwal", "Harjit Dhaliwal", "Tyler", "Anneliese", "Tyler Kowalchuk", "Harjit Kaur", "Stefan"], "companies": ["Friesen Tkachuk Law Office", "Red River Realty Group Inc.", "Assiniboine Prairie Credit Union", "Lavallée & Partners LLP"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 1.0999999977648258, "modelMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 23, "text": "Anneliese Friesen", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Anneliese Friesen